<view class="container game-page">
  <view class="topline">
    <text class="game-kicker">思维闯关 · 07</text>
    <text class="title-badge">4 个数 · 24</text>
  </view>
  <view class="title-row">
    <text class="game-title">24点</text>
    <text class="title-badge">60 秒思维</text>
  </view>
  <view class="game-lead">四个数各用一次，只允许 + − × ÷ 和括号，结果必须正好是 24。有些牌必须经过分数。</view>

  <view class="status-line">
    <text class="status-strong">{{status}}</text>
    <text class="mono">{{cards.length}} 个数</text>
  </view>

  <view class="cards">
    <view class="card {{selectedMap[item.id] ? 'selected' : ''}}" wx:for="{{cards}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="tapCard" hover-class="press">
      <text class="num">{{item.value.n}}</text>
      <text wx:if="{{item.value.d !== 1}}" class="den">/{{item.value.d}}</text>
      <text class="expr">{{item.expr}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="expression-bar" wx:if="{{expression}}">上一步：{{expression}}</view>

  <view class="ops">
    <view class="op {{lastOp === item ? 'active' : ''}}" wx:for="{{ops}}" wx:key="index" data-op="{{item}}" bindtap="applyOp" hover-class="press">{{item}}</view>
  </view>
  <view class="ops-note">{{selected.length === 2 ? '已选 2 张，点一个运算符' : '先选两张牌，再点运算符'}}</view>

  <view wx:if="{{won}}" class="win-banner">
    <text class="win-icon">🎉</text>
    <view class="win-copy">
      <text class="win-title">🎉 正好 24</text>
      <text class="win-sub">四张牌都用上，结果精确</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="actions-row">
    <view class="btn-ghost" bindtap="undo" wx:if="{{canUndo}}">撤销</view>
    <view class="btn-ghost" bindtap="showHint">提示</view>
    <view class="btn-primary" bindtap="newPuzzle">换一题</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{hint}}" class="hint-box">{{hint}}</view>

  <view class="rule-box">
    <view class="rule-title">能学到什么 · 有理数与穷举搜索</view>
    <view class="rule-text">例如 3、3、8、8：8 ÷ (3 − 8 ÷ 3) = 24。只允许整数四则运算，就永远凑不出来。</view>
    <view class="rule-example">例：3、3、8、8 只试整数会卡住；用 8÷(3−8÷3) 经过分数，才能得到 24。</view>
  </view>
</view>
